summary:
KFC Unit Growth of 7%; Yum! Completes Pizza Hut Divestiture;

Returns $1.8 Billion to Shareholders Through Dividends and Share Repurchases Year-to-Date;

Taco Bell U.S. Outpaces the QSR Industry Since End of September

LOUISVILLE, Ky., November 03, 2026--(BUSINESS WIRE)--Yum! Brands, Inc. (NYSE: YUM) today reported results for the third quarter ended September 30, 2026. Third-quarter GAAP EPS was $5.92 and third-quarter EPS excluding Special Items was $1.56.

