Yum Brands reported fourth quarter and full-year 2025 results Wednesday, which included global system sales growth of 5%, led by Taco Bell at 8% and KFC at 6%. The company opened 1,814 gross units, marking a 3% year-over-year increase, and generated more than $11 billion in digital sales, with the mix through digital channels at nearly 60%.&nbsp;

